        'TRANSLATE EVERY MEMBER AND BOTH HALVES: “Bauer | Aerospace” = “Bauer | Lucht- en ruimtevaart”; a heading split over lines or spans is one noun phrase: “VERTICAL / balancing machines” = “VERTICALE / balanceermachines”.',
        'FROZEN STRINGS: fix one Dutch form per product, label, CTA and FAQ question, then repeat it exactly in nav, card, H1, <title>, meta, FAQ, alt and chips. A title quoted in a sentence loses its colon: “regarding E-motor test stands: precision testing for electric motors” = “over e-motortestbanken voor precisietests van elektromotoren”.',
